Verdict: NOT_SUPPORTED
Rationale: The claim states that the high security prison holding one of the two arrestees from the 18 September 2014 counter-terrorism raid opened in the year 2001. However, the evidence from HM Prison Maghaberry clearly states that it opened in 1986, not 2001. This directly contradicts the claim. Additionally, the identity of the prison holding the arrestee is not confirmed in the evidence, leaving this part of the claim insufficiently supported. Therefore, the claim is NOT_SUPPORTED due to the contradiction in the opening year of the prison.
